Test assets used by the CTest suites live here.

`emptyproject.mmp` is exercised by `tests/integration` as a headless application/render smoke test. The integration contract is that MXM successfully renders the project and produces a structurally valid RIFF/WAVE file. Do not use an exact output hash as the cross-platform contract; byte-identical output is a separate requirement and should be tested with a purpose-built deterministic fixture when needed.
